                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "57d78775-d34c-3318-9d0c-d70fa23ff24f",
                        "entry_id": "6dab5974-076b-339d-8f5a-e5ac682fa997",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Invigorating or stimulating."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6a331c3f-0829-49c5-bf07-9178ae897bf0",
                                "sense_id": "57d78775-d34c-3318-9d0c-d70fa23ff24f",
                                "text": "Gaining the more open water, the bracing breeze waxed fresh; the little Moss tossed the quick foam from her bows, as a young colt his snortings."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b66551f3-ccc9-433c-9dc1-215d2a3ef360",
                                "sense_id": "57d78775-d34c-3318-9d0c-d70fa23ff24f",
                                "text": "The stories did not seem to me to touch life. They were plainly intended to have a bracing moral effect, and perhaps had this result for the people at whom they were aimed."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "88727a12-7b47-45c5-af24-e8e69ad07788",
                                "sense_id": "57d78775-d34c-3318-9d0c-d70fa23ff24f",
                                "text": "The tide was out, and we drew up amid the strong bracing smell of seaweed, with gulls screeching, wheeling around, and gliding on the wind."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "db214ce5-8094-4777-bc45-91b800f487b8",
                                "sense_id": "57d78775-d34c-3318-9d0c-d70fa23ff24f",
                                "text": "Stephen Fineman, a professor at the University of Bath’s School of Management, wrote a bracing paper in 2006 on overly cheery corporate practices."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3d002289-90b4-465a-af5e-46d13374adbd",
                        "source_entry_id": "6dab5974-076b-339d-8f5a-e5ac682fa997",
